ources, and embark on a unique adventure, alone or with up to 4 players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Arabic, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Ukrainian, Czech, Romanian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625420/e618a699ed6d62bd52ec9b2d5220373888f3640f/header.jpg?t=1788101967", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625420/5e79c9d089ce939fe07f32ff16a27561dd2c0df4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788101967", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625420/5e79c9d089ce939fe07f32ff16a27561dd2c0df4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788101967", "website": "https://drivebeyondhorizons.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600@ 3.1 GHz or AMD R5 1600X @ 3.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 or equivalent</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 10400 3.1 GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 2600x 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 or equivalent</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>